---
description: "Use store-backed form state for API submission features"
globs:
  - "SampleRag.Client/src/features/**/ui/**/*.{ts,tsx}"
  - "SampleRag.Client/src/pages/**/ui/**/*.{ts,tsx}"
  - "SampleRag.Client/src/widgets/**/ui/**/*.{ts,tsx}"
alwaysApply: false
---

- For API submission flows, form payload state MUST be managed through a dedicated Zustand store (feature store or shared store), not ad-hoc local component state.
- Submission components should behave as controlled forms bound to store state.
- New submission features must define explicit store fields for payload values, update actions per field, and reset actions after successful submit.
